      "description": "The text explicitly labels the visual entity Adam_Schiff with derogatory political and financial accusations. The mapping is direct: the text 'anti-american democrat adam schiff funded by america-hating george soros' is projected onto the visual of Adam_Schiff, identifying him with these false and inflammatory attributes. This is a clear analogical mapping where the textual description defines the visual entity's perceived identity in the meme's context.",
